<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subter-fŭgĭo</span></b> ,
			fūgi, 3, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to flee secretly</i>
			or <i>by stealth</i>, <i>to get off</i>
			(so very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subterfugisse sic mihi hodie Chrysalum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Bacch. 4, 6, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 42, 6,
			20</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to escape</i>, <i>evade</i>, <i>avoid</i>, <i>shun</i> (class.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a favorite word of Cic.): mare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 1, 2, 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vim criminum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Verr. 1, 3, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imprudentiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 4, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">militiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Off. 3, 26, 97</span></i>
			: poenam aut calamitatem,
			<i><span class="en">id.
				Caecin. 34, 100</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">periculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fam. 15, 1, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia quasi fata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Lael. 10, 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tempestatem Punici belli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					31, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus fisci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 23</span></i>
			.—With <i>inf.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. Decl. 6, 12</span></i>
			.</div>
